{"author":"rebar-bridge[bot]","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1794978517636347689,"compiled_state":{"alias":"sporting-feudalist-bluet","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":3,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"44230703dd6261860deccca90f9dd1bdce40f42b881f07073491077c4e84a572","event_uuid":"f9c51bc0-8adf-4dc4-b349-210aea4e1668","position":{"commit_sha":"f5d31c493b2f2860a4c29e60b112d8f757a8249d","position":"1794978494543551164-f9c51bc0-8adf-4dc4-b349-210aea4e1668"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"c83f66d925a8f7401f3e8b897a96f143fab69d9cd9bc4efeb2d8924ade707d6e","event_uuid":"28343a07-1f56-4178-8f2b-4376171da870","position":{"commit_sha":"8447ca43c42675af08ff3655194908c2207f6ab9","position":"1794978513647068149-28343a07-1f56-4178-8f2b-4376171da870"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"a0f4a54228dc27627f65de5c7e94d26be6e83d82468f944c92467b6bd209a7bd","event_uuid":"9562619e-d767-4667-94dc-4913e7c9730e","position":{"commit_sha":"9ca07ceff2451d5ae2ec8702a866bc504156a7bb","position":"1794978517636347688-9562619e-d767-4667-94dc-4913e7c9730e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1794978494543551164,"creation_channel":"mcp","deps":[{"link_uuid":"28343a07-1f56-4178-8f2b-4376171da870","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"c691-bbc1-4217-4cf4"},{"link_uuid":"9562619e-d767-4667-94dc-4913e7c9730e","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"b8dd-85be-1dbb-45b9"}],"description":"## Observation\nIn run 44232977541 at dd72b461814, the \"sweep (windows)\" job (134562252974) failed `tests/unit/test_unique_cache_writes.py::test_concurrent_cursor_writes_never_report_a_write_error`:\n\n`AssertionError: a concurrent cursor write was silently dropped: ['reconcile_cursor_write_error']` (`tests/unit/test_unique_cache_writes.py:182`)\n\nThe test races 2 threads through `rebar.review_bot.reconcile._write_cursor`, with a barrier on the replace step. The same test did not fail in the Windows sweeps of runs 44211859981 (fc446d89df7) or 44141097601 (83ca81e709e).\n\n## Hypotheses (unproven)\n- Windows `os.replace` raises `PermissionError` when the target is held open, or is being replaced concurrently, by the other writer. POSIX rename semantics allow that.\n- An intermittent race that the earlier runs did not hit.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The failing OSError (type and winerror) is captured from a Windows run, with the test's emitted event kwargs recorded.\n- [ ] Concurrent cursor writes on Windows never emit `reconcile_cursor_write_error`, with the cause fixed at class level.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","b8dd-85be-1dbb-45b9"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f59a-4c53-9452-4d3f","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Windows: concurrent review-bot cursor writes emit reconcile_cursor_write_error","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f9c51bc0-8adf-4dc4-b349-210aea4e1668","28343a07-1f56-4178-8f2b-4376171da870","9562619e-d767-4667-94dc-4913e7c9730e"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1794978517636347689,"uuid":"ee412311-df0b-4254-b248-f096400bd373"}